{10007}{Hullo!  Damned good to meet you, old boy!}{Hullo!  SO good to make your acquaintance, madam!}{}{1}{}{ }
{10008}{Hello!  Can I help you, sir?}{Hello!  Can I help you, madam?}{}{2}{}{ }
{10009}{Greetings...}{Greetings...}{}{3}{}{ }
{10010}{Well!  Hello again!  And again, it's my pleasure!}{Well!  Hello again!  And again, it's my pleasure!}{}{4}{}{ }
{10011}{Oh!  It's you!  Nice to see you again...}{Oh!  It's you!  Nice to see you again...}{}{5}{}{ }
{10012}{We meet once again...}{We meet once again...}{}{6}{}{ }
{10014}{I'm all done with that...}{I'm all done with that...}{}{7}{}{ }
{10015}{I'm not one to pass judgment, but for god's sake man!  Put some covering on, will you?}{I'm not one to pass judgment, but for god's sake madam!  Put some covering on, will you?}{}{8}{}{ }
{10016}{Jolly good joke, old boy!  Barbarian armor!  Ha ha!}{Jolly good joke, madam!  Barbarian armor!  Ha ha!}{}{9}{}{ }
{10017}{Well, I've never seen such a motley crew in my whole life!}{Well, I've never seen such a motley crew in my whole life!}{}{10}{}{ }
{10018}{Oh, it's with the magick, is it?  Its amusing, although to whom I'm not all that sure...}{Oh, it's with the magick, is it?  Its amusing, although to whom I'm not all that sure...}{}{11}{}{ }
{10019}{Oh, goodness!  It seems you've fallen under hard times, friend!}{Oh, goodness!  It seems you've fallen under hard times, friend!}{}{12}{}{ }
{10021}{What?  Who's there?  Bloody magickers and their damned sense of humor...}{What?  Who's there?  Bloody magickers and their damned sense of humor...}{}{13}{}{ }
{11000}{You're a coward if I've ever seen one...}{You're a coward if I've ever seen one...}{}{14}{}{ }
{11001}{Eh...what do YOU want?}{Eh...what do YOU want?}{}{15}{}{ }
{11002}{Good god!  You're repulsive!  Get away from me!}{Good god!  You're repulsive!  Get away from me!}{}{16}{}{ }
{11003}{YOU again?  Did I ask you to come back here and bother?}{YOU again?  Did I ask you to come back here and bother?}{}{17}{}{ }
{11004}{Oh, what have I done to deserve this?}{Oh, what have I done to deserve this?}{}{18}{}{ }
{11005}{Oh!  Now there's a bit of bad luck!  You're smaller than a shrimp's chapeau!}{Oh!  Now there's a bit of bad luck!  You're smaller than a shrimp's chapeau!}{}{19}{}{ }
{12016}{Sorry, old chap.  I don't travel with people as evil as yourself...}{Sorry, madam.  I don't travel with people as evil as yourself...}{}{20}{}{ }
{12017}{Eh...no, I don't think so.  I really just don't like you much...}{Eh...no, I don't think so.  I really just don't like you much...}{}{21}{}{ }
{12018}{Alright then!  Good day to you!}{Alright then!  Good day to you!}{}{22}{}{ }
{12019}{Well, I daresay I'm glad to be leaving!  Good riddance!}{Well, I daresay I'm glad to be leaving!  Good riddance!}{}{23}{}{ }
{12020}{I'll get right to it!}{I'll get right to it!}{}{24}{}{ }
{12021}{Sorry, but I'm not going to do that...}{Sorry, but I'm not going to do that...}{}{25}{}{ }
{12022}{Hullo!  You're hitting the wrong chap!}{Hullo!  You're hitting the wrong chap!}{}{26}{}{ }
{12023}{Bravo!  Jolly good strike, my good man!}{Bravo!  Jolly good strike, madam!}{}{27}{}{ }
{12024}{Oh!  That wasn't your most skillful strike...}{Oh!  That wasn't your most skillful strike...}{}{28}{}{ }
{12026}{No...I think you've fully outfitted this group.  Too many for my tastes...}{No...I think you've fully outfitted this group.  Too many for my tastes...}{}{29}{}{ }
{12027}{Sorry, but I don't think you're quite ready for leadership yet...}{Sorry, but I don't think you're quite ready for leadership yet...}{}{30}{}{ }
{12028}{No...I think you'd best go out adventuring for a while, and come back later...}{No...I think you'd best go out adventuring for a while, and come back later...}{}{31}{}{ }
{12029}{Well!  That's my cue to leave!}{Well!  That's my cue to leave!}{}{32}{}{ }
{12046}{Sorry to interrupt, but perhaps I might be the man for that job!}{Sorry to interrupt, but perhaps I might be the man for that job!}{}{33}{}{ }
{12047}{I say!  What in the bloody hell are you doing?  Don't attack our friends!}{I say!  What in the bloody hell are you doing?  Don't attack our friends!}{}{34}{}{ }
{12048}{Wait!  We shouldn't attack this person!  They're alright in my book!}{Wait!  We shouldn't attack this person!  They're alright in my book!}{}{35}{}{ }
{12049}{Hold on moment!  This person is from my home town!}{Hold on moment!  This person is from my home town!}{}{36}{}{ }
{12050}{No!  This person is a friend of mine!}{No!  This person is a friend of mine!}{}{37}{}{ }
{12052}{You'd best watch yourself!  You get any more evil, and you'll be adventuring without Franklin Payne...}{You'd best watch yourself!  You get any more evil, and you'll be adventuring without Franklin Payne...}{}{38}{}{ }
{12053}{Hate to be a bother, old boy.  But I must tell you that I'm really beginning to dislike you.  If it doesn't change, we may need to go our separate ways...}{Hate to be a bother, madam.  But I must tell you that I'm really beginning to dislike you.  If it doesn't change, we may need to go our separate ways...}{}{39}{}{ }
{12054}{Urrgh!  Well!  I'm quite badly hurt!  This very well might be the end!}{Urrgh!  Well!  I'm quite badly hurt!  This very well might be the end!}{}{40}{}{ }

